WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.650
I'm the ghost nobody has ever found.

2
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:19.170
On the way down, a sensor in my leg may have mistaken a jolt for touchdown, and my engines shut off too early. I've been silent since 1999.

3
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:24.250
My story helped make every Mars landing after me safer.

4
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.690
I thought I had already landed.
